B.EM=A.a(s(["Dynamically rendered different form controls such as **EditText, RadioButtons, CheckBoxes etc** from JSON and saved the completed form to the backend.","Built a inspector-side app where inspectors can view site locations, perform inspections, complete or reject orders efficiently on-site.","Implemented **job order tracking** functionality to monitor the status of each order from **start to completion,** ensuring transparency and accountability."]),t.s)
B.zC=new A.io(B.EM,null)
B.GK=A.a(s(["Built the app from **scratch** with complete control over architecture and implementation.","Integrated the **Skandika freezer machine** into the app for seamless connectivity and control.","Enabled users to **view and adjust the freezer temperature** directly from the app.","Added functionality to **lock or unlock the freezer** via the app for enhanced safety and remote control."]),t.s)
B.zD=new A.io(B.GK,null)
B.G5=A.a(s(["Developed a mobile app for a company selling fitness machines with **BLE capabilities,** enabling users to perform various training programs and track metrics like blood pressure and calories.","Created a **virtual training experience** where cycling video speed adjusts in real-time based on machine pedal speed and altitude, with **Chromecast support,** and added a map view feature showing the track using **GPS data** from the videos, allowing users to **track their position on a real-world route.**","Designed a **scalable architecture** to smoothly integrate new fitness machines with different **BLE protocols,** ensuring easy expansion and maintenance.","Integrated **10+ different fitness machines** using various BLE protocols for seamless communication and **real-time data syncing.**"]),t.s)
B.zE=new A.io(B.G5,null)
B.ER=A.a(s(["Built end to end **e-com application** with admin panel and customer mobile application","Key features : Custom posters ordering , Live chat , Reviews , Order status notifications, **automatic invoice generation using iText7.**","Analytical reports generation for admin app.(Sales, Orders, Revenue, Total Products etc.)","Built backend server using **Ktor and PostgreSql** for database."]),t.s)
B.zF=new A.io(B.ER,null)
B.G1=A.a(s(["You can **directly share a folder** that can be **accessed from any device on the same network** via a web browser!","You can also share a download URL of a particular file on your Android device. **(The link remains valid until you turn off the server from the app.)**","A key feature is that if someone is accessing your shared folder through a browser, they can also upload files to it, which will be saved directly on your Android device.","You can view the download and upload status on **both devices.**","**No internet needed** \u2014 just turn on your hotspot, and **file transfers will take place over Wi-Fi.**"]),t.s)
B.zG=new A.io(B.G1,null)
B.Fs=A.a(s(["Managed the entire web platform independently, ensuring full feature parity with the mobile app and implementing **responsive UI for all screen sizes.**","Integrated **Stripe ACH payments** on the web via **JavaScript interop,** enabling secure and smooth transactions when native support was unavailable.","Used **Flutter MVVM architecture** with the **Provider package** for clear separation of concerns and **scalable state management.**","Built backend functionality using **Cloud Functions written in TypeScript,** along with **Firebase Scheduled Functions (cron jobs)** for tasks like reminders and periodic data updates."]),t.s)
